{"title":"IQOS \u0026 More","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTobacco Meets Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e - While the idea of heating tobacco (instead of burning it) has been around for more than two decades, it took years of research and development to create a product that is acceptable to adult consumers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuy IQOS online in Kenya at Best Prices. Just let us know your quantities we are here to serve you, limited quantities of stock. Place your order online with doorstep delivery only at \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/\" title=\"vapekenya\"\u003e[YOUR BRAND]\u003c\/a\u003e!\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"iqos-2-4-plus-starter-kit","title":"IQOS 2.4 Plus Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS 2.4 Plus Kit, which includes an IQOS Holder and all the tools you need to clean and charge your IQOS. Introducing IQOS Kenya Marlboro Cigarette in Kenya. Buy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos kenya\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e in Kenya at best prices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease Note: IQOS 2.4 plus starter kit doesn't include heets in box. You have to purchase heets separately, \u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos heets Kenya\"\u003eclick here\u003c\/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"heets\"\u003eto\u003c\/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"heets Kenya\"\u003ebuy heets\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41574754156599,"sku":"5","price":8500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-2.4-plus-group-with-4-new-heets-WHITE.jpg?v=1743120604"},{"product_id":"iqos-3-starter-kit","title":"IQOS 3 Duo Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS 3 Starter Kit uses the latest technology – a heating element made of gold and platinum and coated with ceramics to control the heating temperature. Introducing IQOS Kenya Marlboro Cigarette in Kenya. Buy \u003ca title=\"Iqos kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e in Kenya at best prices.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIQOS 3 Duo kit is compatible with Heets Classic, Heets Fiit and Heets Dimensions. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-3-DUO-infographic.jpg?v=1756885422\" alt=\"iqos 3 duo infographic\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease Note: IQOS 3 Duo starter kit doesn't include heets in box. You have to purchase heets separately, \u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Iqos heets Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\"\u003eclick here\u003c\/a\u003e \u003ca title=\"heets\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\"\u003eto\u003c\/a\u003e \u003ca title=\"heets Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\"\u003ebuy heets\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652548272183,"sku":"IQOS 3 Starter Kit","price":9950.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-3-Starter-Kit.jpg?v=1756885548"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-bronze","title":"IQOS Terea Bronze","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTerea Bronze - Rich, warm taste experience. A mild, aromatic tobacco blend with notes of cocoa and dried fruits. \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c\/strong\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that IQOS ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41673628549175,"sku":"Terea Bronze - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673628581943,"sku":"Terea Bronze - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-bronze.jpg?v=1747872097"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-yellow","title":"IQOS Terea Yellow","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTerea Yellow - Mildly spicy taste experience. A mild, aromatic tobacco blend with light, spicy aroma notes. \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c\/strong\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos\"\u003eIQOS \u003c\/a\u003eILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41673628614711,"sku":"Terea Yellow - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673628647479,"sku":"Terea Yellow - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-yellow-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750033763"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-amber","title":"IQOS Terea Amber","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTerea Amber \u003c\/strong\u003e- Balanced-roasted taste experience. A well-rounded, roasted tobacco blend with a finely scented note of wood and nut aromas. \u003cem\u003eFor use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos devices\"\u003eIQOS devices\u003c\/a\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eIluma\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eis the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that IQOS ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41673628680247,"sku":"Terea Amber - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673628713015,"sku":"Terea Amber - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-amber-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750033802"},{"product_id":"iqos-4-0-iluma-starter-kit","title":"IQOS 4.0 Iluma Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS ILUMA line is the so-called Iqos 4.0 - the fourth generation of the most popular heat-not-burn devices in the world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma, takes the appeal of heat-not-burn tobacco to a new level with the new technology Smart Core Induction System™, maintaining the original IQOS technology that heats tobacco leaves directly from the inside.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma has familiar design, which can be said to be a standard model of IQOS, but has been evolved. We have achieved a simple feel that fits comfortably in your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDevice can be used two times continuously. It also has an auto start function that automatically starts heating.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIMPORTANT NOTE:\u003c\/strong\u003e IQOS ILUMA is designed to be used only with TEREA heating tobacco units. Do not use IQOS ILUMA and TEREA heating tobacco units with older generations of IQOS, as you may damage your device.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma is designed for use with Smart Core Stick™ only. Do not use IQOS Iluma and Smart Core Stick™ with traditional IQOS devices (IQOS 3 Duo and earlier models) and their dedicated tobacco sticks. This can damage the device. Shop Iqos \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673628778551,"sku":"Iluma 4.0 Starter Kit","price":18000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-iluma-starter-kit.jpg?v=1747872110"},{"product_id":"iqos-heets-slate-selection","title":"IQOS HEETS Slate Selection","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHeets Slate Selection (ex Yellow Selection) flavor is soft and fragrant mellow tobacco blend with some spicy notes. For use with IQOS devices.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41673629335607,"sku":"Heets Slate Selection - Pack","price":590.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673629368375,"sku":"Heets Slate Selection - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Heets-Parliament-Slate-Selection.jpg?v=1747872144"},{"product_id":"iqos-heets-summer-breeze","title":"IQOS HEETS Summer Breeze","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSummer Breeze HEETS - New menthol cooling sensation enriched with bold fruity aroma notes and floral nuances is HEETS Summer Breeze in a peach-colored pack.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIQOS have created an alternative for adult smokers who would otherwise continue to smoke cigarettes and want to enjoy real tobacco taste without the smoke or ash of cigarettes. This product is not intended for non smokers or ex smokers and is compatible only with the IQOS device. Do not smoke or use with other devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eEach HEETS stick contains 0.5mg of nicotine and other flavor options are available.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41673629663287,"sku":"Heets Summer Breeze - Pack","price":590.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673629696055,"sku":"Heets Summer Breeze - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/heets-summer-breeze.jpg?v=1747872147"},{"product_id":"heets-amber-label","title":"IQOS HEETS Amber Label","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAmber Label HEETS - A rich tobacco blend.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIQOS have created an alternative for adult smokers who would otherwise continue to smoke cigarettes and want to enjoy real tobacco taste without the smoke or ash of cigarettes. 