35,"sku":"Heets Blue Label - Carton","price":5450.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/heets-blue.jpg?v=1747872782"},{"product_id":"heets-sienna-label","title":"IQOS HEETS Sienna Label","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSienna Label HEETS - An intense tobacco blend.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS have created an alternative for adult smokers who would otherwise continue to smoke cigarettes and want to enjoy real tobacco taste without the smoke or ash of cigarettes. This product is not intended for non smokers or ex smokers and is compatible only with the IQOS device. Do not smoke or use with other devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach HEETS stick contains 0.5mg of nicotine and other flavour options are available.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41673635954743,"sku":"Heets Sienna Label - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673635987511,"sku":"Heets Sienna Label - Carton","price":8400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/heetssiennacart.jpg?v=1747872785"},{"product_id":"iqos-heets-dimensions-yugen","title":"IQOS HEETS Dimensions Yugen","description":"\u003cp\u003eIqos Heets Dimensions Yugen is made of fresh chords of aromatic herbs and floral tinge will keep you amazed. You will feel the fruity tones with the creaminess of tobacco.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCarton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco 