79"},{"product_id":"iqos-fiit-regular","title":"IQOS Fiit - Regular","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit Regular is an aromatic tobacco blend with nutty notes. Made for Lil Solid. Fully compatible with IQOS 3 Duo \u0026amp; earlier devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit is the discovery of the real taste of tobacco and new sensations. Natural tobacco, processed and pressed under a special technology, provides taste and aroma when heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA special biopolymer film allows to maintain a comfortable level of temperature and humidity of the tobacco vapor generated when the tobacco is heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrice is per carton and pack. 1 carton contains 10 packs x 20 sticks = 200 sticks. Similarly, 1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41710159003703,"sku":"Fiit Regular - Pack","price":600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710159036471,"sku":"Fiit Regular- Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/fiit-regular-carton.jpg?v=1750030832"},{"product_id":"iqos-fiit-regular-sky","title":"IQOS Fiit - Regular Sky","description":"\u003cp\u003eIqos Fiit Regular Sky has a pure tobacco taste, light and unobtrusive. Made for Lil Solid. Fully compatible with IQOS 3 Duo \u0026amp; earlier devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit is the discovery of the real taste of tobacco and new sensations. Natural tobacco, processed and pressed under a special technology, provides taste and aroma when heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA special biopolymer film allows to maintain a comfortable level of temperature and humidity of the tobacco vapor generated when the tobacco is heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrice is per carton and pack. 1 carton contains 10 packs x 20 sticks = 200 sticks. Similarly, 1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41710161133623,"sku":"Fiit - Regular Sky - Pack","price":600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710161166391,"sku":"Fiit - Regular Sky - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/fiit-regular-sky-carton.jpg?v=1750031224"},{"product_id":"iqos-fiit-tropic","title":"IQOS Fiit - Tropic","description":"\u003cp\u003eIqos Fiit Tropic is a balanced tobacco blend with refreshing menthol and flavour of sunny tropical fruits. Made for Lil Solid. Fully compatible with IQOS 3 Duo \u0026amp; earlier devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit is the discovery of the real taste of tobacco and new sensations. Natural tobacco, processed and pressed under a special technology, provides taste and aroma when heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA special biopolymer film allows to maintain a comfortable level of temperature and humidity of the tobacco vapor generated when the tobacco is heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrice is per carton and pack. 1 carton contains 10 packs x 20 sticks = 200 sticks. Similarly, 1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41710161264695,"sku":"Fiit Tropic - Pack","price":600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710161297463,"sku":"Fiit Tropic - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/fiit-tropic-carton.jpg?v=1750031684"},{"product_id":"iqos-fiit-crisp","title":"IQOS Fiit - Crisp","description":"\u003cp\u003eIqos Fiit Crisp is a mild tobacco blend with refreshing menthol and citrus notes. Made for Lil Solid. Fully compatible with IQOS 3 Duo \u0026amp; earlier devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit is the discovery of the real taste of tobacco and new sensations. Natural tobacco, processed and pressed under a special technology, provides taste and aroma when heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA special biopolymer film allows to maintain a comfortable level of temperature and humidity of the tobacco vapor generated when the tobacco is heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrice is per carton and pack. 1 carton contains 10 packs x 20 sticks = 200 sticks. Similarly, 1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41710162542647,"sku":"Fiit Crisp - Pack","price":600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710162575415,"sku":"Fiit Crisp - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/fiit-crisp-carton.jpg?v=1750031926"},{"product_id":"iqos-fiit-viola","title":"IQOS Fiit - Viola","description":"\u003cp\u003eIqos \u003cspan\u003eFiit Viola is a balanced tobacco blend with a cooling menthol effect and juicy berry notes\u003c\/span\u003e. Made for Lil Solid. Fully compatible with IQOS 3 Duo \u0026amp; earlier devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit is the discovery of the real taste of tobacco and new sensations. Natural tobacco, processed and pressed under a special technology, provides taste and aroma when heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA special biopolymer film allows to maintain a comfortable level of temperature and humidity of the tobacco vapor generated when the tobacco is heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrice is per carton and pack. 1 carton contains 10 packs x 20 sticks = 200 sticks. Similarly, 1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41710162608183,"sku":"Fiit - Viola - Pack","price":600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710162640951,"sku":"Fiit Viola - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/fiit-viola-carton.jpg?v=1750032080"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-blue","title":"IQOS Terea Blue","description":"\u003cp\u003eTerea Blue has an intense menthol flavor blended with mellow tobacco and enhanced by hints of peppermint. For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos\"\u003eIQOS \u003c\/a\u003eILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41710172602423,"sku":"Terea Blue - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710172635191,"sku":"Terea Blue - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-blue-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750034433"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-sienna","title":"IQOS Terea Sienna","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIQOS Terea Sienna - Balanced, woody taste experience. A well-rounded, roasted tobacco blend with woody notes and subtle tea aromas.\u003c\/span\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos devices\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41710173454391,"sku":"Terea Sienna - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710173487159,"sku":"Terea Sienna - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-sienna-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750034594"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-green","title":"IQOS Terea Green","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIQOS Terea Green has a menthol freshness stronger than Turquoise, enhanced by green, minty aroma notes.\u003c\/span\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos devices\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41710173782071,"sku":"Terea Green - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710173814839,"sku":"Terea Green - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-green-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750034790"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-purple-wave","title":"IQOS Terea Purple Wave","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIQOS Terea Purple Wave (Mauve Wave) has a rich fruity flavor with refreshing menthol and a mild forest fruit aroma.\u003c\/span\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos devices\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41710179811383,"sku":"Terea Purple Wave - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710179844151,"sku":"Terea Purple Wave - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-purple-wave-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750034939"},{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-oasis-limited-edition","title":"IQOS Iluma - Oasis Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the exclusive IQOS LUMA OASIS, a stylish and unique addition to the IQOS family. This sleek gadget will be the perfect choice for those who want to quit conventional cigarettes and switch to a healthier alternative. Thanks to the advanced SMARTCORE INDUCTION SYSTEM tobacco heating technology, you will get the most comfortable and clean use without ash and odor. The amount of contamination is minimized, so you no longer have to spend time cleaning the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe design of OASIS is simply stunning. It is made in bright and saturated colors that will take you to a world of amazing landscapes and adventures. This limited edition will be a great addition to your look and will make you stand out from the crowd.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the millions of IQOS users around the world and start enjoying all the benefits of heated tobacco. Despite the limited edition, you still have the opportunity to own this stylish and functional device. Don't miss your chance!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDevice Colour: OASIS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNumber of sessions with one full charge: 20 sessions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 135 min\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHolder dimension \u0026amp; weight:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight - 101.mm, Diameter - 14.5 mm, Weight - 30.5grm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePocket charger dimension and weight:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight - 117.2mm, Width — 44.7mm, Weight - 141grm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging port: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery capacity: 2380mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperating temperature: 0°C ~ 40°C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Connectivity: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDevice Compatible with: TEREA sticks\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging time: 2h 15m\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating temperature: 350 °C (660 °F)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating method: Smartcore induction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating time: 15 sec\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSession length: up to 6 minutes \/ 14 puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41710201897015,"sku":"Iluma - Oasis Ltd Edition","price":19990.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-iluma-oasis-limited-edition.jpg?v=1750038453"},{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-i-standard-blue-breeze","title":"IQOS Iluma i Standard - Blue Breeze","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma I Standard Breeze Blue tobacco heater has a familiar design and functionality and has been brought to perfection. In addition to induction contactless heating of tobacco and cleanliness when smoking, this device has several improvements. It makes it a bestseller in the ash-free smoking market. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma I Standard Breeze Blue has a touch screen with clear indications. This makes the device look stylish and perform a practical role. With one light push, the e-cigarette goes into pause mode. You can return to the session in a couple of minutes. On the screen, you can see how many sessions you can smoke in a row at the moment — 1 or 2. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe indication also displays the state of tobacco heating. Select the economical consumption mode to charge the battery less often or the maximum performance mode to smoke two sessions in a row and make the most puffs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma I Standard (Breeze Blue) Specifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe heater body is made of aluminum.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColor: Breeze blue.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe heating temperature is 350 degrees.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating type: induction.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 5.9 x 8.8 x 15.4 cm; 0.1 g.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe battery capacity of the device is 2900 mAh.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFull charge time of the case is 135 minutes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay with indication and control.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePause during the session.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMode that adds more puffs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEconomy mode.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility with sticks: Terea Iluma.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41710214119479,"sku":"Iluma i Standard - Blue Breeze","price":19000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Iluma-i-Standard-Blue-Breeze.jpg?v=1750039282"},{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-one-kit","title":"IQOS Iluma One Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe IQOS ILUMA ONE takes tobacco heating to the next level. A stylish, compact and portable device using the beloved IQOS technology that has 20 consecutive uses per charge. Its convenient all in one design requires no cleaning and is excellent for everyday usage, no matter where you are.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll-in-one design, offering up to 20 consecutive uses with a single charge. Next level tobacco experience without blades.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis IQOS device is ONLY compatible with IQOS Terea Sticks\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact all in one device.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes SMARTCORE INDUCTION SYSTEM™ technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to 20 consecutive uses with a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy insertion and extraction of the stick\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRapid charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo cleaning ever\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomisation options with accessories\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy switch to IQOS ILUMA ONE?\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReal Tobacco taste: IQOS ILUMA is specially designed to be used with real tobacco sticks. TEREA sticks provide real tobacco taste \u0026amp; satisfaction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHarm Reduction: Switching completely to IQOS presents less risk to your health than continuing to smoke. IQOS emits 95% lower levels of harmful chemicals compared to cigarettes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote: Compatible only with Terea Sticks.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41712608018487,"sku":"Iluma One Kit","price":15000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-iluma-one-pebble-beige.jpg?v=1750126480"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-berrine-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Berrine Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eTerea Cigarette Berrine Edition -Cooling and floral tobacco sensation with Indonesian cloves. A blend of fine tobacco with Indonesian cloves and refreshing cooling menthol enriched with fruity and floral aromas.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that IQOS ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41763726131255,"sku":"Terea Berrine Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41763726164023,"sku":"Terea Berrine Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos_terea_stick_berrine_edition_cigarette.webp?v=1751932813"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-emerald-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Emerald Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea cigarette\"\u003eTerea Cigarette\u003c\/a\u003e Emerald Edition - This flavour can become a real gem of your tobacco collection. You will especially like it if you prefer soft, minty freshness without a strong menthol hit. The whole ensemble is complemented by notes of fresh fruits. There is no unnecessary sweetness in the taste. Each stick is designed for about 14 puffs or 6 minutes of smoking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour of Terea Emerald Edition Indonesia: Fresh fruity and minty scent.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764568727607,"sku":"Terea Emerald Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764568760375,"sku":"Terea Emerald Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-Emerald-Edition.webp?v=1751933276"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-black-green","title":"IQOS Terea Black Green","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS TEREA Black Green is a revolutionary way to enjoy tobacco - intense menthol cooling sensation complemented by a mellow tobacco blend and highlighted with green fruit aromas. With no smoke or ash, you can enjoy a smoother and more satisfying tobacco experience every time. Heat-not-burn technology ensures harmful chemicals and tar are eliminated from your experience. Get your own \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Iqos Terea\"\u003eIQOS TEREA\u003c\/a\u003e Black Green today!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764571742263,"sku":"Terea Black Green - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764571775031,"sku":"Terea Black Green - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-cigarette-Black-Green-pack.webp?v=1751933460"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-bright-wave","title":"IQOS Terea Bright Wave","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS TEREA Bright Wave offers an extraordinary tobacco experience with deep menthol cooling sensations and green fruit and fresh aromas. Enjoy the same taste and satisfaction of smoking, but without the smoke and ash thanks to our heat-not-burn technology, which eliminates harmful chemicals and tar. Get a smoother, more enjoyable tobacco experience with \u003ca title=\"Iqos Terea\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\"\u003eIQOS TEREA\u003c\/a\u003e Bright Wave!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea Stick\"\u003eTerea stick\u003c\/a\u003e is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764576952375,"sku":"Terea Bright Wave - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764576985143,"sku":"Terea Bright Wave - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-cigarette-bright-wave-pack.webp?v=1751933770"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-yugen-dimensions","title":"IQOS Terea Yugen Dimensions","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS TEREA Dimensions Yugen is the perfect device for a unique and satisfying smoking experience. Carefully crafted with a special blend of tobacco, ripe fruit and floral aromas, the device heats rather than burns resulting in a cleaner and smoother smoking. Enjoy the unique mix of sensations for a truly enjoyable experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the \u003ca title=\"Terea Stick\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\"\u003eTerea stick\u003c\/a\u003e is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764577902647,"sku":"Terea Yugen Dimensions - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764577935415,"sku":"Terea Yugen Dimension - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-cigarette-dimensions-yugen.webp?v=1751934043"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-mulint-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Mulint Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlavour of Terea Cigarette Mulint Edition: Mint and mulberry scent combined with cloves.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach Terea Mulint Edition ILUMA cigarette comes with a structure equivalent to a traditional cigarette. Users can use the product within 6 minutes. That is, users can use it with 14 continuous puffs. However, this number is only an estimate because each person will have a different time to inhale the cigarette. However, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea Indonesia cigarette\"\u003eTerea Indonesia cigarettes \u003c\/a\u003eare still highly appreciated in terms of dosage and usage time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe product will appeal to users who love unusual flavour solutions. Moderately sweet and refreshing, it is perfectly complemented by quality Indonesian tobacco. We offer original high-quality sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764580130871,"sku":"Terea Mulint Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764580163639,"sku":"Terea Mulint Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-cigarette-Mulint-Edition.webp?v=1751934515"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-golden-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Golden Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlavour of Terea Golden Edition: Traditional nutty and woody aroma.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach Terea Golden Edition ILUMA cigarette comes with a structure equivalent to a traditional cigarette. This flavour is called golden for its excellent balance and harmony. The combination of aromatic Indonesian tobacco, nut and wood notes creates a wonderful smoking experience, transporting the user to the atmosphere of a languid evening. This taste will be appreciated by all lovers of the classics.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrefer it if you consider fruit and berry aromas too sweet.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764583276599,"sku":"Terea Golden Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764583309367,"sku":"Terea Golden Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-cigarette-golden-edition-pack.webp?v=1751935248"},{"product_id":"iqos-heets-turquoise-selection","title":"IQOS HEETS Turquoise Selection","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHEETS are a completely new way to enjoy tobacco. Made from the finest leaf and produced into small 'sticks', they open up a whole new world of taste and flavour.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41807676145719,"sku":"Heets Turquoise Selection - Pack","price":590.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41807676178487,"sku":"Heets Turquoise Selection - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-heets-turquoise-selection-flavor.webp?v=1754264996"},{"product_id":"iqos-heets-silver-selection","title":"IQOS HEETS Silver Selection","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco cigarette. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHEETS cigarettes are a completely new way to enjoy tobacco. Made from the finest leaf and produced into small 'sticks', they open up a whole new world of taste and flavour.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41807701114935,"sku":"Heets Silver Selection - Pack","price":590.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41807701147703,"sku":"Heets Silver Selection - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-heets-silver-selection.webp?v=1754265184"},{"product_id":"iqos-lil-solid-2-0","title":"IQOS Lil Solid 2.0","description":"\u003cp\u003eEasy to use all-in-one device, with 25 sessions on one full charge, and the time of each session is increased to about 5 minutes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS introduces Lil Solid 2.0 to bring a smoke-free future even closer.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine a world where everything is simple, easy and convenient. A world where there is nothing superfluous, but the most important thing remains. A world of enjoying the taste of real tobacco, but without smoke and ash.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe tobacco in \u003ca title=\"Iqos devices\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-iluma\"\u003eIQOS device\u003c\/a\u003e Lil Solid 2.0 heats up rather than burns, so there is no fire or ash during use. This means that there is no risk of burning your clothes or furniture, and you do not risk damaging the carpet or upholstery in the car by falling ash.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso when using Lil Solid 2.0, tobacco vapor (aerosol) is emitted, so there is no smell of cigarette smoke.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReleased: 2021\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDevice type: All-in-one\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: KT\u0026amp;G, introduced by PMI\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging port type: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 106 ? 31 ? 22 mm \/ 4.17 x 1.22 x 0.87 in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 99 g \/ 3.5 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery capacity: 2950 mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsecutive uses: 3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUses per full charge: 25\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging time: 2 h\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating temperature: 350 °C (660 °F)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating method: Heating pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating time: 25 sec\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible Sticks type: \u003ca title=\"Fiit cigarettes\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-fiit\"\u003eFiit cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e, \u0026amp; \u003ca title=\"Heets cigarettes\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/heets-cigarette\"\u003eHeets cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSession length: 5 minutes or 14 puff\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41807728967735,"sku":"Lil Solid 2.0","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/lil-solid-20-stone-grey-super-shipping-2.webp?v=1754265999"},{"product_id":"iqos-heets-sun-pearl","title":"IQOS HEETS Sun Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Heets Sun Pearl pack has a laconic design with a red background. HEETS tobacco sticks are designed to be used with a tobacco heating system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA balanced, roasted tobacco blend with light hints of spicy herbs. And when you press the button, reveals a pleasantly refreshing taste with hints of summer berries.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAromatic notes\u003c\/strong\u003e: from balanced tobacco to refreshing summer berry and menthol notes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41838497398839,"sku":"Heets Sun Pearl - Pack","price":590.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41838497431607,"sku":"Heets Sun Pearl - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-heets-sun-pearl.jpg?v=1755830943"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-zing-wave","title":"IQOS Terea Zing Wave","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eTEREA ZING WAVE brings a refreshing new dimension to the world of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eterea\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e. Designed exclusively for IQOS ILUMA, this flavor combines crisp menthol with a zing of citrus, offering a cool yet energetic sensation with every puff.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41838501724215,"sku":"Terea Zing Wave - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41838501756983,"sku":"Terea Zing Wave - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-Zing-Wave.jpg?v=1755831419"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-turquoise","title":"IQOS Terea Turquoise","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTurquoise Terea are intended for use with the IQOS ILUMA device and have a mild tobacco mix flavour with a spicy menthol finish. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41838507098167,"sku":"Terea Turquoise - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41838507130935,"sku":"Terea Turquoise - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-TEREA-Turquoise-carton.webp?v=1755831770"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-silver","title":"IQOS Terea Silver","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSilver Terea: Balanced blend of toasted tobacco, delicately refined with light aromatic notes of spicy herbs. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41880919900215,"sku":"Terea Silver - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41880919932983,"sku":"Terea Silver - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-silver-for-iqos-iluma.webp?v=1758179129"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-summer-wave","title":"IQOS Terea Summer Wave","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTerea Summer Wave (Coral Tide) has an aromatic fruity flavor of ripe peach with floral notes and mild menthol freshness. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea cigarette\"\u003eterea cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41880934514743,"sku":"Terea Summer Wave - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41880934547511,"sku":"Terea Summer Wave - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-summer-wave-cigarette.webp?v=1758179638"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets.oembed?page=2","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}





